    "intro_narrative": "The rain beats heavily against the foggy windows of the abandoned safe house. For months, you have been tracking 'The Architects,' a notorious underground syndicate operating in the city's shadows. Tonight, a breakthrough led you to this hidden command center. At the heart of the room stands a massive, electronically sealed vault containing the syndicate's true identities and ledger. However, they didn't leave it unprotected. A web of complex, interdependent cryptographic mechanisms guards the final lock. Time is running out—patrols will return by dawn. You must analyze the fragmented evidence scattered around the room, trace the connections, and decrypt the system to crack the case wide open.",
